install.

The full build (1,005 KB raw / 326 KB gzipped) rather than the smaller `common`
one, which does not register the heatmap series this view is built on — see
dash/ui.go for the measurement and why grepping the file for "heatmap" is
misleading. The `simple` build omits dataZoom as well.

